[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mIf you approach investing with a disciplined savings rate, proper investment criteria, and reasonable expectations, you can do well.[0m                         [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
