[32m│[0m  [32mWhen you buy a stock, you own a piece of the underlying business. It’s important to understand the quality of the business you own for the same reason you [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mwould test-drive a new car before buying it.[0m                                                                                                                 [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mThe best companies tend to exceed your expectations. They find investment opportunities that you might not have thought about or that you wouldn’t be able [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mto pursue as an individual, increasing the intrinsic value of their business. Over time, these companies tend to be worth much more than they are today.[0m     [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mLong term, our analysts think having a stake in [a high-quality company](https://www.morningstar.com/financial-advisors/what-makes-company-great) will put [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32myou in a far better position than chasing market movements or the brief boom of a low-quality business. With that in mind, here is a group of rock-solid [0m    [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mcompanies that are truly positioned to stand the test of time.[0m                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32m> Having a stake in a high-quality company will put you in a far better position than chasing market movements or the brief boom of a low-quality business.[0m  [32m│[0m
