[32m│[0m  [32mand defense firms, as well as transportation services. More companies from the industrials sector made our list than from any other group.[0m                   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mMany of the good companies in the [industrials sector](https://www.morningstar.com/sectors/industrials) benefit from their incumbent position in their [0m      [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mrespective industries. It allows these businesses to develop brands and patents that give them their edge. Many further benefit from a cost advantage, [0m      [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32moperating in industries where infrastructure or regulation limitations make it expensive for new competitors to enter the market.[0m                            [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
