[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mIn addition, it is always crucial to stay on top of [sell signals](https://www.investors.com/ibd-university/how-to-sell/). Any stock that falls 7% or 8% [0m    [32m│[0m
