[32m│[0m  [32m [0m                                                                                                                                                            [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mSHOP[0m                                                                                                                                                         [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32m)**,5 he says, whose e-commerce platform enables merchants worldwide to process orders and payments and manage inventories.[0m                                  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32m![](/bin-public/600_Fidelity_Com_English/images/learning-center/charts-and-graphics/quality%20stocks_flywheel%20effect.png)[0m                                  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32m### The flywheel effect[0m                                                                                                                                      [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mWhat’s confounded many investors during the past few years—the “[Mag 7](https://www.fidelity.com/learning-center/smart-money/magnificent-7-stocks)” age—is [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mthat many of the fastest-expanding companies have also been the biggest companies. “It’s counterintuitive, since in economics we learn that at some point [0m   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mit gets harder to grow,” says Anolic.[0m                                                                                                                        [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32m**Alphabet ([0m                                                                                                                                                 [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mWe're sorry, quotes are currently unavailable. Please try again.[0m                                                                                             [32m│[0m
