[32m│[0m  [32mGOOGL[0m                                                                                                                                                        [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32m)**6 and **Meta Platforms ([0m                                                                                                                                  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mWe're sorry, quotes are currently unavailable. Please try again.[0m                                                                                             [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32m [0m                                                                                                                                                            [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mMETA[0m                                                                                                                                                         [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32m)**7 have illustrated the different dynamics and economics of successful internet business models. Both operate “self-sustaining, self-reinforcing [0m          [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mflywheels,” says Weiner, with powerful network effects and billions of customers logging on daily for activities such as search, social media, advertising,[0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mand communication.[0m                                                                                                                                           [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32m“These businesses have gotten better and grown faster as they’ve become bigger,” he says. Anolic observes that businesses such as these have not only [0m       [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32moutgrown the market for 15 years but also have vastly eclipsed the growth rates for traditional blue-chip compounders—and without significantly more [0m        [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mvolatility. Web-based services such as Amazon and Google have become as ingrained in daily life as toothpaste or paper towels.[0m                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mBlue Chip Growth’s Kalra, who was a media analyst prior to becoming a fund manager, describes how advertising has been fundamentally redefined by the [0m       [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32marrival of digital advertising. “Ad dollars follow eyeballs, and as eyeballs shifted from traditional to digital media, so did ad dollars,” he says. [0m        [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mAlphabet and Meta have been 2 of the biggest beneficiaries of that migration and together have been generating close to $500 billion annually in digital ad[0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mrevenue. “When you’re a market leader, you enjoy economies of scale,” he says. “Over the last 10–15 years, these have been ‘winner takes most’ markets.”[0m     [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mThe same logic attracted Kalra to **Netflix ([0m                                                                                                                [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
