[32m│[0m  [32mNFLX[0m                                                                                                                                                         [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32m)**,8 the global leader in streaming. He says the economics of Netflix’s huge worldwide viewing base permit it to attract top talent, pay industry-leading [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mcompensation, and churn out new TV series and movies. Simnegar, who has also favored the stock, likes its “foundation of recurring revenue, which provides [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32munparalleled visibility into future cash flow.” He notes that even after 2 decades of “cutting-edge innovation,” Netflix was able to add 41 million net new[0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32msubscribers in 2024.[0m                                                                                                                                         [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                                                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mKalra thinks that **Roblox ([0m                                                                                                                                 [32m│[0m
