[32m│[0m  [32m)**,9 which operates one of the largest video-gaming platforms, has also started enjoying the flywheel effect. “Video games are a hit-driven business,” he [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32msays. In other words, gaming platforms need a regular cadence of hot trending games to keep users coming back, the way streaming services constantly need [0m   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mnew hit shows and movies. “More and more studio publishers are developing games on the Roblox platform, which is driving more hits—a virtuous development [0m   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [32mcycle.”[0m                                                                                                                                                      [32m│[0m
